    "text": "youroregonnews.com\nwebsite\nEstacada\nEstacada breaks ground on ‘generational’ wastewater facility\nBy Christopher Keizur,\n1 days agoThe city of Estacada has taken the first real step in the largest municipal project it has ever endeavored toward. Officials broke ground Monday, Aug. 11, on the new Wastewater Treatment Plant, 805 N.W. Evergreen Way. That is in Portal Park, across the street from the aging current wastewater plant.",
